+
+**Research date:** 2026-07-20 (Asia/Tbilisi)  
+**Decision scope:** generated Apple workspace foundation  
+**Decision status:** handed off for review  
+**Evidence toolchain:** Xcode 26.5 (17F42), Swift 6.3.2, macOS 26.5,
